"section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"迁广汉。后夷反叛，辞〔曰〕：‘令得前何府君，乃能安我耳！’时难〔复〕屈祗，拔祗族人为〔之〕，汶山复得安","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":370,"end":421,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-42262cc1f83283283376","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"二县户口猥多，切近都治，饶诸奸秽。每比人，常眠睡；值其觉寤，辄得奸诈。众咸畏祗之发摘，或以为有术，无敢欺者","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":272,"end":325,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-4c21c2def03f347d75d8","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"初仕郡，后为督军从事","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":165,"end":175,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-5d6e8cfdee011833d8ba","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"时诸葛亮用法峻密，阴闻祗游戏放纵，不勤所职；尝奄往录狱，众人咸为祗惧。祗密闻之，夜张灯火见囚，读诸解状。诸葛晨往，祗悉已暗诵；答对解释，无所凝滞。亮甚异之","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":176,"end":253,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-683ad9f01337efefc80d","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"使人投算，祗听其读而心计之；不差升合，其精如此","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":326,"end":349,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-9630f7b77420e667e935","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"每朝会，祗次洪坐。嘲祗曰：‘君马何驶？’祗曰：‘故吏马不敢驶，但明府未著鞭耳！’众传之以为笑","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":16,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-ab8aa585a2bce55208a5","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"汶山夷不安，以祗为汶山太守，民、夷服信","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":350,"end":369,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-af1060d585bdd4c66289","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-9fdcbc190275cf56490e","layer":"original","quote":"洪迎门下书佐何祗〖34〗，有才策功干〖35〗，举郡吏，数年为广汉太守；时洪亦尚在蜀郡","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":30,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-b791be2b24d8cd28854a","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"转祗为犍为。年四十八卒，如直所言","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":422,"end":438,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-bc8bcc755c2108f27c9f","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-402b8dd12cfa86663358","layer":"pei","quote":"尝梦井中生桑，以问占梦赵直，直曰：‘桑非井中之物，会当移植；然“桑”字四十下八，君寿恐不过此。’祗笑言：‘得此足矣！","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧传•杂记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c2ad504755adcbb9bb52","start":106,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
